                    "frequency": "Low",
                    "semantic_group_id": "physical_shape",
                    "name_type": "no",
                    "examples": [
                        {
                            "text": "The old horse had a <w>swayed</w> back after years of carrying heavy loads.",
                            "target_lang_translations": {
                                "ru": "У старой лошади была <w>прогнутая</w> спина после многих лет переноски тяжелых грузов."
                            }
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "Veterinarians often check for <w>swayed</w> spines in older animals.",
                            "target_lang_translations": {
